   "宇宙魔王兵 display \"Demon Soldier\" (drops King/Space to fit 15); 皇国兵 display \"Empire Soldier\" rather than \"Imp. Soldier\".",
   "アヤナミレイ: display \"Rei (Tentative)\"; given \"Rei (Tentative Name)\" + family \"Ayanami\" follows the Japanese split, so given+family does not read exactly as glossary \"Rei Ayanami (Tentative Name)\".",
   "Angels written without \"the\" (glossary robot entries have \"the Fourth Angel\"); Jigoku shipped \"Eighth Angel\".",
   "高性能ＡＩ display \"Advanced AI\" (Jigoku) vs family \"High-Performance AI\" (glossary).",
   "Coined: \"Chrono Reformist Member\" (クロノ改革派隊員), \"Maint. Soldier\", \"Kugel Crewman\", \"Fleet Execs\", \"Cmdr. Tanaka\", \"Mech. Beast\", \"Dim. Beast\", \"Auto. Circuit\", \"Black Lightning\"."
  ],
